ere FEW edges are, never where the ANSWER is. It pays when scarcity happens to coincide with decisiveness, costs nothing when it does not, and is actively harmful when an adversary puts bulk on a scarce channel. FNA-1's headline must carry that scope, and this hostile is the reason it can.\"", "}"]}
